Algorithm: Structured Question Answering 
1)Start
2)Convert input text into structured representation
3)Store structured data in a knowledge base
4)Accept question from the user
5)Convert question into structured form
6)Match question structure with stored structures
7)If a match is found, extract the required field
8)Display the extracted answer
9)If no match is found, display “No answer found”
10)Stop

